OL,3,GNEWSAAldi apologises over parking      
OL,4,Acherry picker at vets                  
OL,6,FA good-natured dispute between a major 
OL,7,Fsupermarket and a Derbyshire vet has   
OL,8,Fended after some jokey posts on social 
OL,9,Fmedia.                                 
OL,11,FDerwent Valley Vets, in Matlock in     
OL,12,FDerbyshire, posted that a cherry picker
OL,13,Flinked to the building of a new Aldi   
OL,14,Fnearby was taking up precious spaces in
OL,15,Fits small car park after it appeared on
OL,16,FWednesday.                             
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
